; Inventory: list what the subject carries
;
; Default handler of inventory (id 26; VerbHandlers). Prints "<subj_is> carrying." and
; then the objects held by the subject, or "Nothing" when it holds none present (the
; contents of held containers are listed with them, #R$9FAF).
@label=VerbInventory
c$90EB CALL $9D44          ; only when really performing
 $90EE LD HL,$ADF6         ; "<subj_is> carrying."
 $90F1 CALL $72DD          ; print it
 $90F4 LD A,($B6EA)        ; the subject
 $90F7 CALL $9D97          ; how many present things does it hold?
 $90FA AND A               ;
 $90FB LD HL,$B33B         ; "Nothing"
 $90FE JP Z,$72DD          ; none: print it
 $9101 LD A,($B6EA)        ; the subject is the holder...
 $9104 LD IX,($B70C)       ; the actor
 $9108 LD B,(IX+$10)       ; B = where it is
 $910B JP $9FAF            ; list what the subject holds
